{"id":"e2db788b9ba8ebdc","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-elementary-chain.md","title":"ZFC Elementary Chain","display":"df-zfc-elementary-chain — ZFC Elementary Chain","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-elementary-chain","aliases":["58-df-zfc-elementary-chain"],"display":"df-zfc-elementary-chain — ZFC Elementary Chain","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-linear-order.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-elementary-chain"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-elementary-chain</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-elementary-chain — ZFC Elementary Chain"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b40aa6d4a7d8288a\" href=\"?note=b40aa6d4a7d8288a\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-linear-order.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-linear-order.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"faf104362ffe13b3\" href=\"?note=faf104362ffe13b3\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md\">../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec M,I,\\leq_I,L\\in V\">\\(\\vec M,I,\\leq_I,L\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S\\)</span> (linear-order predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b40aa6d4a7d8288a\" href=\"?note=b40aa6d4a7d8288a\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-linear-order.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-linear-order.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\)</span> (structure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementaryChain}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementaryChain}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prec_L\">\\(\\prec_L\\)</span> (elementary-substructure relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"faf104362ffe13b3\" href=\"?note=faf104362ffe13b3\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md\">../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}chain} \\vdash \\mathrm{ElementaryChain}_S(\\vec M,I,\\leq_I,L)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S(I,\\leq_I)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec M,I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec M))\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M_i,L)\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;(\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in\\leq_I\\to M_i\\prec_L M_j)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}chain} \\vdash \\mathrm{ElementaryChain}_S(\\vec M,I,\\leq_I,L)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S(I,\\leq_I)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec M,I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec M))\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M_i,L)\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;(\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in\\leq_I\\to M_i\\prec_L M_j)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The index order, structure class, and elementary-substructure relation now have explicit sources; the former <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Str}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{Str}_L\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preceq_L\">\\(\\preceq_L\\)</span> were unsupported notation.</li>\n<li>The chain is a set function into its set-valued range; the proper class of all <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-structures is no longer used as a function codomain.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-linear-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"b40aa6d4a7d8288a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-linear-order.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md","status":"resolved","id":"faf104362ffe13b3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-linear-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"b40aa6d4a7d8288a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S$ (linear-order predicate, see [[../batch15/58-df-zfc-linear-order.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}_S$ (structure predicate, see [[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (set-function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md","status":"resolved","id":"faf104362ffe13b3","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\prec_L$ (elementary-substructure relation, see [[../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\vec M,I,\\leq_I,L\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ElementaryChain}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\prec_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}chain} \\vdash \\mathrm{ElementaryChain}_S(\\vec M,I,\\leq_I,L)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S(I,\\leq_I)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec M,I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec M))\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M_i,L)\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;(\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in\\leq_I\\to M_i\\prec_L M_j)","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Str}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\preceq_L","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false}],"bytes":1600,"backlinks":[{"id":"67be5c48288e58ea","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ElementaryChain}_S$ is the four-place predicate from [[../batch11/58-df-zfc-elementary-chain.md]]"},{"id":"f9f220f2e2969a98","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1862","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-elementary-chain.md|58-df-zfc-elementary-chain]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","b40aa6d4a7d8288a","d9b8711cda3f31ca","faf104362ffe13b3","36d7463d215be751"]}